{"description":"Halloween at Supermarket 🎃\nHalloween at Supermarket with a live band to start the night, followed by a DJ until close.\nCome in costume and ready to dance.\nDetails\nOct 31 · 9 PM–2:00 AM\nSupermarket, Kensington Market\n19+ with valid ID\nFull bar\nCostumes encouraged\nTickets\nPrices increase as each release sells out. Buying earlier gets you the lowest price.","organizer":"Jojo Rosenzweig"}